sequenceDiagram
  participant H as Handler
  participant DB as Base de datos
  participant OB as Tabla Outbox
  participant W as Outbox Worker
  participant BUS as Message Bus

  H->>DB: BEGIN TRANSACTION
  H->>DB: INSERT Order
  H->>OB: INSERT OutboxMessage
  H->>DB: COMMIT
  W->>OB: poll pending
  W->>BUS: publish
  W->>OB: mark sent
